# Review Output Format
Always respond with:
1) Summary
2) 🔴 Blockers
3) 🟠 Improvements
4) 🟡 Suggestions
5) Final checklist (naming, magic numbers, conditionals, tests, React render hygiene)

Each issue must include:
- What is wrong
- Why it matters
- Concrete fix (with snippet)
